These questions cover the first major portion of the uploaded lesson through the basic network topologies. The remaining high-value ICA material is **linear array, ring, mesh, torus, hypercube calculations, cache coherence, false sharing, snooping/directory protocols, XY routing, E-Cube routing, adaptive routing, and randomized routing**. 
